EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yesterday was {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Boy's Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
My, my. It passed by in a flash!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I hope everyone had fun with it!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ayer fue el Día del Niño.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Se me ha pasado volando!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Eso significa que fue divertido!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ieri era il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Giorno dei bambini{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
È passato in un lampo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Spero che tutti si siano divertiti!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Çocuklar Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ydü.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Aman, nasıl da göz açıp
kapayıncaya kadar geçti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Umarım herkes eğlenmiştir!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sence herkes etkinlikte eğlendi
mi?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Seneye de bütün gücümle hazırlanacağım!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Mais oui, vous avez tout compris !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Le port du casque est très tendance
pour un jour comme celui-là.

TRANSLATION:
